@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #eef2f7
skinparam StateBorderColor #666666
title AW Arbiter FSM (per slave) -- round-robin with grant locking

[*] --> IDLE
IDLE : entry / aw_grant_matrix[s] = 0
IDLE : entry / aw_grant_active[s] = 0
IDLE : monitor aw_request_matrix[s]
IDLE : track priority via aw_last_grant[s]

GRANT_ACTIVE : entry / aw_grant_matrix[s][m] = 1
GRANT_ACTIVE : entry / aw_grant_active[s] = 1
GRANT_ACTIVE : hold grant until AWVALID && AWREADY
GRANT_ACTIVE : W data mux follows the AW grant

IDLE --> GRANT_ACTIVE : any master requests\n(round-robin picks winner m)
GRANT_ACTIVE --> IDLE : AW handshake completes\nupdate aw_last_grant[s] = m
GRANT_ACTIVE --> GRANT_ACTIVE : handshake not yet complete\n(grant is LOCKED)

note right of GRANT_ACTIVE
  B responses are routed by the
  ID table, NOT by this grant.
end note
@enduml
